        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Teton Valley Trails and Pathways – PAWS Ambassador Program</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/49594.webp" alt="Teton Valley Trails and Pathways – PAWS Ambassador Program" loading="lazy">
